Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:06:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll, server: Add msync, Rosetta code regions and
 WINEDLLPATH_PREPEND.

Unchanged from hsr-wine-d3dmetal patches/wine-p3/0001-host-msync.patch (LGPL-2.1-or-later,
derived from CrossOver FOSS 26.3): msync, Rosetta code-region registration through
libd3dshared, the PE-side __wine_unix_call carry, the GS overlay and WINEDLLPATH_PREPEND. The
server headers are regenerated with tools/make_requests (protocol 962).

Topic: msync
